        ("s1", "Setup", "Diana, remember the empty court from before? Let's go back there, the morning after a loss.", "Diana, remember the empty court from before? <break time=\"0.4s\"/> Let's go back there, the morning after a loss.", 1.4, "measured", "warm", ["morning after"], "Callback, direct continuation."),
        ("s2", "The loss", "Last night, on that same court, there was a loss. It happens. It happens to everyone.", "Last night, on that same court, there was a loss. <break time=\"0.4s\"/> It happens. <break time=\"0.4s\"/> It happens to everyone.", 1.4, "measured", "steady", ["happens to everyone"], "Matter-of-fact, no drama."),
        ("s3", "How it feels", "It doesn't feel good. It's not supposed to. Let's not pretend it does.", "It doesn't feel good. <break time=\"0.4s\"/> It's not supposed to. <break time=\"0.4s\"/> Let's not pretend it does. <break time=\"2.5s\"/>", 2.5, "slow", "gentle", ["not pretend"], "Pause beat one. Honour the real feeling."),
