        ("s5", "Two choices", "There are two things you could do here. Explain the loss away and go home. Or come back and actually look at it.", "There are two things you could do here. <break time=\"0.4s\"/> Explain the loss away and go home. <break time=\"0.4s\"/> Or come back and actually look at it.", 1.4, "measured", "steady", ["actually look"], "Set the contrast clearly."),
        ("s6", "The choice point", "Explaining it away feels better for about five minutes. Looking at it is what actually changes anything.", "Explaining it away feels better for about five minutes. <break time=\"0.4s\"/> Looking at it is what actually changes anything.", 1.4, "slow", "warm", ["actually changes"], "The heart of the film."),
        ("s7", "Who comes back", "So the person who comes back to the empty court isn't pretending the loss didn't hurt. They just decided to do something with it.", "So the person who comes back to the empty court isn't pretending the loss didn't hurt. <break time=\"0.5s\"/> They just decided to do something with it.", 1.4, "measured", "steady", ["do something with it"], "Reframe returning, not denial."),
        ("s8", "Not about forgetting", "This isn't about forgetting the loss and moving on quickly. It's about staying with it just long enough to learn from it.", "This isn't about forgetting the loss and moving on quickly. <break time=\"0.5s\"/> It's about staying with it just long enough to learn from it.", 1.4, "measured", "gentle", ["long enough"], "Correct the misconception directly."),
        ("s9", "Her own loss", "Think of a time you lost at something. What did you tell yourself the next day?", "Think of a time you lost at something. <break time=\"0.4s\"/> What did you tell yourself the next day?", 1.4, "measured", "gentle", ["next day"], "Genuine question."),
        ("s10", "Reflect", "Was it an excuse, or was it an actual look at what happened? Either is alright to admit.", "Was it an excuse, or was it an actual look at what happened? <break time=\"0.4s\"/> Either is alright to admit. <break time=\"2.5s\"/>", 2.5, "slow", "gentle", ["alright to admit"], "Pause beat two. Non-judgemental."),
        ("s11", "It's hard both times", "It's hard to lose. And it's hard to go back to the empty court afterwards. Both things can be true.", "It's hard to lose. <break time=\"0.4s\"/> And it's hard to go back to the empty court afterwards. <break time=\"0.4s\"/> Both things can be true.", 1.4, "measured", "steady", ["both true"], "Honour the difficulty of the corrective too."),
        ("s12", "One thing", "So here's your move. After a loss, name one thing, just one, you'd work on if you went back right now.", "So here's your move. <break time=\"0.5s\"/> After a loss, name one thing, just one, <break time=\"0.4s\"/> you'd work on if you went back right now. <break time=\"2.5s\"/>", 2.5, "measured", "encouraging", ["one thing"], "Pause beat three. The actual tool, kept small."),
        ("s13", "Just one thing", "Just one. Not the whole game. One thing is enough to start with.", "Just one. <break time=\"0.4s\"/> Not the whole game. <break time=\"0.4s\"/> One thing is enough to start with.", 1.4, "measured", "warm", ["enough to start"], "Keep the ask manageable."),
        ("s14", "Same court, new day", "It's the same court as before, Diana. Win or lose, it's still there in the morning, waiting.", "It's the same court as before, Diana. <break time=\"0.4s\"/> Win or lose, it's still there in the morning, <break time=\"0.4s\"/> waiting.", 1.4, "measured", "warm", ["still there"], "Callback to the earlier film, tie the two together."),
